{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0104_1000_023aka", "source_sha256": "5140fa3067e1d1253def3851f0d9e704421c670f903db4af51a15a02a0d2898a", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん、お疲れ～！\n……あれ？　なんか、疲れた顔してない？", "zh": "小{$P$}，辛苦啰～！\n……咦？你怎么好像满脸疲倦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0104_1001_p", "source_sha256": "81bd6635ae7785b19c4637772a1a501d9cba2289ee2a9cf06fbecb7d6131ca8c", "ja": "お疲れさま、茜。そうかな？\nちゃんと寝たんだけど……。", "zh": "茜，你也辛苦了。我看起来很累吗？\n但我有睡饱啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0104_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f0864d7bb9b9de386fdc83e767a7bd3207f36e5c9c64a554e22fdcbd00e21a05", "ja": "それより新しい衣装、いい感じじゃないか。\nうん、よく似合ってるよ。", "zh": "不说这个了，新服装感觉很不错嘛。\n嗯，非常适合你喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0104_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "0dbd39f9972a4bef5f37746dffea5bdb903f9f7e97621668df65d89e3aa803f9", "ja": "そうだよ！　茜ちゃん、すっ……ごくカワイイでしょ？\n見てるだけで癒やされて、ナデナデしたくなるでしょ？", "zh": "就是说啊！小茜超──级可爱的吧？\n让你光看就觉得疗愈，想要摸头对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0104_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "bc002af459b0d7ff255d80f7046133ac221ee2136f1b619a9b7eb3b1294b61a2", "ja": "なのに{$P$}ちゃんは、\n疲れた顔をしている。もしかして……。", "zh": "可是小{$P$}却一脸疲倦。\n难道……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0104_1005_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0104_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "1abce21c551779f89e3951e3b6f6d61037b06f8882f2da0cd4d44bf401d7da20", "ja": "わかった、茜ちゃん切れだ！\n茜ちゃん成分が不足しているんだね？", "zh": "小茜知道了，你是缺乏小茜！\n你体内的小茜成分不足了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0104_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "184e1dc0ad283a383d562aa50a6fb228801977e2a36fb5c4356f01ca4fe51504", "ja": "しょうがないな～、特別に、ナデナデしてもいいよ！\nさあ{$P$}ちゃん、どーぞ♪", "zh": "真拿你没办法，就破例让你摸摸头吧！\n来，小{$P$}，请摸吧──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0104_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d1a1c4eaa57644653d8960ac682026dcf3467ad2c1d524ffb1c4f9ffaf9815c8", "ja": "茜は相変わらずだな……。\nまあ、茜を探していたのは本当だけど。", "zh": "茜还是老样子呢……\n不过，我确实一直在找你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0104_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "7c5b483dbeb9d350fdb97dbf198750cb0d4d2fd2dd7dd8a31cf171cde367fc21", "ja": "え、もしかしてホントに補給しに来たの？\nそりゃ茜ちゃんは美少女だし、気持ちはわかるけど。", "zh": "咦？难道你真的是来补充小茜的吗？\n毕竟小茜是美少女，也是能理解你的心情啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0104_1010_p", "source_sha256": "72151a9f5446acad756888c4760ae131b5e4ab9e1ba3b406aaf2ca765ec60f3a", "ja": "いや、そうじゃなくて……はい、届け物だ。\n青羽さんから茜にって。", "zh": "不是，我不是那个意思……我是来送东西的。\n这是青羽小姐要我转交给你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0104_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "eff48c4b2d155a286404e127c4b90bb5d90f9731ac5c7be162c7be0e12d9c066", "ja": "これは……765プロ劇場きっての美少女、\n野々原茜ちゃんに宛てられたファンレターの数々！？", "zh": "这是……寄给765艺能剧场首屈一指的美少女，\n野野原茜的无数粉丝信！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0104_1012_p", "source_sha256": "2cd5ebf0ef650626cae8cdc7505031d0c75d047edf31db9c95e622e67d0163ed", "ja": "前置きが長いけど、そのとおりだ。\n新しい衣装の感想も、もう届き始めてるみたいだな。", "zh": "形容词太长了，但你说的没错。\n粉丝对新服装的感想似乎也陆续寄到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0104_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "84a4c94e153dcc1f37a37c4451fb16f4deb1c631f14de7ef5825a4a5e7b2bf66", "ja": "そう……とうとう、この時が来てしまったんだね。\n茜ちゃんという可能性に、世界が気づく時が！", "zh": "这样啊……这个时刻终于到来了呀。\n名为小茜的可能性被全世界察觉到的时刻要来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0104_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "4adafe1ab05ac1e3ef7ab713951b016e4bd9d56ecf569cd252111ef25c6c2a55", "ja": "おっと、その前に。\n{$P$}ちゃん、ありがとね！", "zh": "哎呀，在说这个之前，\n小{$P$}，谢谢你啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0104_1015_p", "source_sha256": "76abe421bce775e10be70e701af8e59324de2fb6234630391ce1a06510984215", "ja": "え？\nいや、その手紙は俺が書いたわけじゃないけど。", "zh": "咦？\n等等，那些信可不是我写的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0104_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "e4a16d10aaec949911dbc6675fd8fc62cf014808c918a5f67f34dab5ee020013", "ja": "んもー、そうじゃなくて！\nそういうボケいらないから、今！", "zh": "真是的──不是这个意思啦！\n现在不需要这样装傻啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0104_1017_p", "source_sha256": "41f69390477d7cbbff8123a1207d10c7b8786f153705b5abcdd2f3af35d0be22", "ja": "じゃあ、なんで急に……？", "zh": "那你怎么突然道谢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0104_1018_023aka", "source_sha256": "18e1e4d0722114f2922e88fbeb65bdf36b1cc3f070d4b842e58bb9029ba52452", "ja": "茜ちゃんは、賢くてクレバーだからね！\n誰のおかげかくらい、ちゃんとわかってるんだよ。", "zh": "因为小茜聪明又体贴啊！\n小茜很清楚这都是托谁的福喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0104_1019_023aka", "source_sha256": "21d0c91ced366aac17fc304ee9d3bcdf8bf0e1664b67bc5bdc367a03dff355ca", "ja": "この衣装、茜ちゃんにすっごく似合ってると思う！\nカワイイ茜ちゃんの魅力をさらに引き立てる優れモノ！", "zh": "这套服装很适合小茜！\n能将可爱小茜的魅力衬托得更出众，非常优秀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0104_1020_023aka", "source_sha256": "15d3b443d4ee0ec1f4f5f93d0a09b46134e5f874d92e46baf09071d8ae046b54", "ja": "茜ちゃん、この衣装すーっごく気に入っちゃった♪\nだから……。", "zh": "小茜非──常喜欢这套服装♪\n所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0104_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "6e4ccd1b5e1d3a168d4458b7f71e1cd23e756c385eb2e4fb3a49e53c3ca2c79b", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん、お礼が欲しいよね？\nカワイイ茜ちゃんの、感謝のしるしが欲しいよね？", "zh": "小{$P$}，你想要回礼吧？\n想要可爱的小茜表达谢意对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0104_1022_p", "source_sha256": "43b2bb3312b8380efd0f988285d5bed4ccb391db5c8f514bb78da4f9023a2190", "ja": "いや、気を遣ってくれなくても。\n茜がちゃんとレッスンしてくれれば、それで……。", "zh": "不用了，你不需要费心。\n我只要你好好参加练习就够了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0104_1023_023aka", "source_sha256": "9498705077d2ccf696c3c7574eb80426f6d208734aef184d7cbe7addeda6d4dc", "ja": "そこまで言うなら仕方ないな～。じゃあ特別に、\nカワイイ茜ちゃんが、チョコを作ってきてあげよう！", "zh": "既然你都这么说了，那就没办法啦～\n就让可爱的小茜破例做巧克力送你吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0104_1024_023aka", "source_sha256": "f5031ac47e4bbd020fc56a969e620f9f8b4d34e99570ba421a3d0816b42bee40", "ja": "世界一カワイイ女子高生、茜ちゃんが作るチョコだよ！\nプライスレス！　ノドから手が出るほど欲しいよね？", "zh": "是世界第一可爱的女高中生，小茜做的巧克力喔！\n这是无价之宝！你应该想要得不得了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0104_1025_p", "source_sha256": "3a855c4a418113c1852cab2989c2c8c453410253d114022fca37ce0c010c8e16", "ja": "人の話を聞いてないな……まぁいいか。\n確かに、食べてはみたいな。", "zh": "你根本没在听我说话啊……算了。\n我确实是想吃吃看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0104_1026_p", "source_sha256": "fc136b6afc50ac45729916e5f6f2b644766c68644a151f5fa5f6a54a69928cea", "ja": "世界一カワイイ茜が作るチョコだ、\nきっと世界一美味しいはずだもんな！", "zh": "毕竟是世界第一可爱的茜做的巧克力嘛，\n一定会是世界第一好吃吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0104_1027_023aka", "source_sha256": "e1672a65baf58a510d92a8e98b45d3e2bae7434d7d335f8e8f5670e2f9e735ec", "ja": "なんと！？　{$P$}ちゃん、今、\nそこはかとなくハードルを上げてきたね！？", "zh": "什么！？小{$P$}，\n怎么觉得你默默提高难度了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_023aka0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_023aka0104_1028_023aka", "source_sha256": "5d0889e7a0c8e5a1d9f541963f091ab741f1f241df890aff98e668d67d2a506b", "ja": "けど、茜ちゃんは負けないよ！\n絶対美味しいって言わせてやる～！！", "zh": "但是，小茜是不会输的！\n小茜绝对会让你说出「很好吃」～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
